#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`lsm6dsox` --- LSM6DSOX 6-axis IMU"
msgstr ":mod:`lsm6dsox` --- IMU de 6 ejes LSM6DSOX"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:7
msgid ""
"Driver for the ST LSM6DSOX iNEMO 6-axis inertial measurement unit (3-axis "
"accelerometer plus 3-axis gyroscope) over I2C or SPI. In addition to the "
"basic IMU output, the driver exposes the on-chip embedded functions: a "
"configurable pedometer (step counter) and the Machine Learning Core (MLC), "
"which can be programmed via UCF files exported from ST's Unico-GUI tool."
msgstr ""
"Controlador para la unidad de medición inercial iNEMO de 6 ejes LSM6DSOX de "
"ST (acelerómetro de 3 ejes más giroscopio de 3 ejes) a través de I2C o SPI. "
"Además de la salida básica de la IMU, el controlador expone las funciones "
"embebidas del chip: un podómetro configurable (contador de pasos) y el "
"Machine Learning Core (MLC), que puede programarse mediante archivos UCF "
"exportados desde la herramienta Unico-GUI de ST."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:14
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Ejemplo::"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:33
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Clases"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:37
msgid ""
"Construct an ``LSM6DSOX`` instance. The bus type is auto-detected: if "
"``bus`` exposes ``readfrom_mem`` it is treated as a :py:class:`machine.I2C`,"
" otherwise it is treated as a :py:class:`machine.SPI` and ``cs`` must be "
"supplied. The chip is soft-reset, the requested ODR and scale are "
"programmed, and an MLC UCF file is loaded if provided."
msgstr ""
"Construye una instancia de ``LSM6DSOX``. El tipo de bus se detecta "
"automáticamente: si ``bus`` expone ``readfrom_mem`` se trata como un "
":py:class:`machine.I2C`; de lo contrario se trata como un "
":py:class:`machine.SPI` y debe proporcionarse ``cs``. El chip se reinicia "
"por software, se programan la ODR y la escala solicitadas, y se carga un "
"archivo UCF de MLC si se proporciona."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:43
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:44
msgid ""
"Either a configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` or :py:class:`machine.SPI` bus."
msgstr "Un bus :py:class:`machine.I2C` o :py:class:`machine.SPI` configurado."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:47
msgid "``cs``"
msgstr "``cs``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:48
msgid ""
"Chip-select :py:class:`machine.Pin` used in SPI mode. Required when ``bus`` "
"is an SPI instance, ignored otherwise."
msgstr ""
":py:class:`machine.Pin` de selección de chip usado en modo SPI. Es "
"obligatorio cuando ``bus`` es una instancia SPI; en caso contrario se "
"ignora."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:51
msgid "``address``"
msgstr "``address``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:52
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the device. Defaults to ``0x6A``; some boards strap the"
" SDO pin high which selects ``0x6B``."
msgstr ""
"Dirección I2C de 7 bits del dispositivo. Su valor predeterminado es "
"``0x6A``; algunas placas fijan el pin SDO en alto, lo que selecciona "
"``0x6B``."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:55
msgid "``gyro_odr``"
msgstr "``gyro_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:56
msgid ""
"Gyroscope output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0`` (off), ``1.6``, "
"``3.33``, ``6.66``, ``12.5``, ``26``, ``52``, ``104``, ``208``, ``416`` or "
"``888``."
msgstr ""
"Tasa de datos de salida del giroscopio en Hz. Debe ser uno de ``0`` "
"(apagado), ``1.6``, ``3.33``, ``6.66``, ``12.5``, ``26``, ``52``, ``104``, "
"``208``, ``416`` o ``888``."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:60
msgid "``accel_odr``"
msgstr "``accel_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:61
msgid ""
"Accelerometer output data rate in Hz. Same set of values as ``gyro_odr``."
msgstr ""
"Tasa de datos de salida del acelerómetro en Hz. El mismo conjunto de valores"
" que ``gyro_odr``."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:64
msgid "``gyro_scale``"
msgstr "``gyro_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:65
msgid ""
"Gyroscope full-scale range in degrees-per-second. Must be one of ``250``, "
"``500``, ``1000`` or ``2000``."
msgstr ""
"Rango de escala completa del giroscopio en grados por segundo. Debe ser uno "
"de ``250``, ``500``, ``1000`` o ``2000``."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:68
msgid "``accel_scale``"
msgstr "``accel_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:69
msgid ""
"Accelerometer full-scale range in g. Must be one of ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` or "
"``16``."
msgstr ""
"Rango de escala completa del acelerómetro en g. Debe ser uno de ``2``, "
"``4``, ``8`` o ``16``."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:72
msgid "``ucf``"
msgstr "``ucf``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:73
msgid ""
"Optional path to an ST Unico-GUI ``.ucf`` register-dump file. If supplied "
"the file is parsed and applied to the MLC during construction by way of "
":meth:`load_mlc`."
msgstr ""
"Ruta opcional a un archivo de volcado de registros ``.ucf`` de ST Unico-GUI."
" Si se proporciona, el archivo se analiza y se aplica al MLC durante la "
"construcción por medio de :meth:`load_mlc`."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:79
msgid ""
"Issue a software reset via ``CTRL3_C`` and block until the reset bit clears."
" Raises ``OSError`` if the device fails to come back within ten retries."
msgstr ""
"Emite un reinicio por software mediante ``CTRL3_C`` y se bloquea hasta que "
"se borra el bit de reinicio. Lanza ``OSError`` si el dispositivo no vuelve "
"dentro de diez reintentos."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:85
msgid ""
"Switch the FUNC_CFG register bank. Used internally to access the embedded "
"function and sensor-hub register pages; rarely needed by application code."
msgstr ""
"Cambia el banco del registro FUNC_CFG. Se usa internamente para acceder a "
"las páginas de registros de la función embebida y del sensor-hub; el código "
"de aplicación rara vez lo necesita."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:91
msgid ""
"Enable or disable the embedded-function block. When ``enable`` is ``True`` "
"the two-byte ``emb_ab`` tuple is written to "
"``EMB_FUNC_EN_A``/``EMB_FUNC_EN_B``. When ``False`` the current values are "
"read, the MLC/pedometer enable bits are cleared, and the previous values are"
" returned so they can be restored later."
msgstr ""
"Habilita o deshabilita el bloque de funciones embebidas. Cuando ``enable`` "
"es ``True``, la tupla de dos bytes ``emb_ab`` se escribe en "
"``EMB_FUNC_EN_A``/``EMB_FUNC_EN_B``. Cuando es ``False``, se leen los "
"valores actuales, se borran los bits de habilitación del MLC/podómetro y se "
"devuelven los valores anteriores para que puedan restaurarse más tarde."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:99
msgid ""
"Apply an MLC UCF program from the file at path ``ucf``. The driver walks the"
" file line-by-line, applies each ``Ac <reg> <val>`` write, then enables BDU,"
" routes MLC events to interrupt pin 1 and turns the embedded functions back "
"on."
msgstr ""
"Aplica un programa UCF de MLC desde el archivo en la ruta ``ucf``. El "
"controlador recorre el archivo línea por línea, aplica cada escritura ``Ac "
"<reg> <val>``, luego habilita BDU, enruta los eventos del MLC al pin de "
"interrupción 1 y vuelve a activar las funciones embebidas."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:106
msgid ""
"If new MLC results are available (``MLC_STATUS`` bit set), return the "
"contents of the eight ``MLC0_SRC..MLC7_SRC`` registers as a bytes-like "
"object. Otherwise return ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Si hay nuevos resultados del MLC disponibles (bit ``MLC_STATUS`` "
"establecido), devuelve el contenido de los ocho registros "
"``MLC0_SRC..MLC7_SRC`` como un objeto similar a bytes. De lo contrario "
"devuelve ``None``."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:112
msgid "Configure the embedded pedometer."
msgstr "Configura el podómetro embebido."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:114
msgid "``enable``"
msgstr "``enable``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:115
msgid "Enables or disables step detection on the embedded function block."
msgstr ""
"Habilita o deshabilita la detección de pasos en el bloque de funciones "
"embebidas."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:117
msgid "``debounce``"
msgstr "``debounce``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:118
msgid "Step debounce value written into ``PEDO_DEB_STEPS_CONF``."
msgstr "Valor de antirrebote de pasos escrito en ``PEDO_DEB_STEPS_CONF``."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:120
msgid "``int1_enable``"
msgstr "``int1_enable``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:121
msgid "If ``True``, route pedometer events to the ``INT1`` pin."
msgstr "Si es ``True``, enruta los eventos del podómetro al pin ``INT1``."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:123
msgid "``int2_enable``"
msgstr "``int2_enable``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:124
msgid "If ``True``, route pedometer events to the ``INT2`` pin."
msgstr "Si es ``True``, enruta los eventos del podómetro al pin ``INT2``."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:128
msgid "Reset the step counter back to zero."
msgstr "Reinicia el contador de pasos a cero."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:132
msgid "Return the current value of the 16-bit step counter."
msgstr "Devuelve el valor actual del contador de pasos de 16 bits."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:136
msgid "Return the gyroscope vector ``(x, y, z)`` in degrees per second."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve el vector del giroscopio ``(x, y, z)`` en grados por segundo."

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:140
msgid ""
"Return the acceleration vector ``(x, y, z)`` in units of standard gravity (1"
" g = 9.81 m/s²)."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve el vector de aceleración ``(x, y, z)`` en unidades de gravedad "
"estándar (1 g = 9.81 m/s²)."
